      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HALF AS TOUGH (7) finished third at Stawell on July 20 before making up plenty of ground in a sustained run only to find a couple better at his latest appearance over 2200m at this track. Has to contend with a very wide draw. Primary contender if anywhere near his best. ROYAL ROCKSTAR (4) did well to finish second two starts ago at Mildura but didn't measure up at his latest appearance over 2190m at Mildura, beaten 23 metres into sixth after being close to the pace throughout. Won't find this any harder and he can finish a lot closer this time. FIRESIDE (11) is worth another chance after a last-start seventh over 2190m at Maryborough three-and-a-half weeks ago. SEASIDE LADY (9) has been about the mark of late and must be respected, the latest offering a sound fifth at Kilmore over 1690m.",
